# =============================================================================
# super-note .dockerignore
# 收窄 build context：加速 docker build、避免把本地数据/APK 拖进镜像层
# Phase 0+1 优化
# =============================================================================

# --- 版本控制 / CI ---
.git
.github
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# --- 文档 / 周边 ---
*.md
docs
design
weixin.jpg
LICENSE
test-results
**/*.map

# --- 本地运行时数据（致命：曾把 160MB+ 附件打进 context）---
backend/data
**/super-note.db
**/super-note.db-*
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
super-note-data
nowen-note-data
openlist-data
**/attachments
**/backups

# --- Node 依赖 / 构建产物（容器内重新 npm ci + build）---
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-electron
**/dist-fpk
**/build
**/.cache
**/.turbo
**/.next
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*

# --- 桌面端 / 移动端工程（Docker 服务端镜像不需要）---
electron
android
ios
frontend/android
frontend/ios
capacitor.config.*
build-resources
packages

# --- 下载页大文件：APK ~37MB，不进镜像（设置页可链外链；需要时本地挂载）---
# clipper zip 很小可保留；仅排除 apk
**/*.apk
frontend/public/downloads/*.apk

# --- 飞牛 fpk / 打包脚本临时产物 ---
scripts/fpk/work
scripts/fpk/dist
release
out

# --- IDE / 系统文件 ---
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# --- 根目录其它噪声（勿用 *.sh 以免误伤 docker-entrypoint.sh）---
electron-builder.yml
build_docker.sh
dev.sh
scripts
